# BGLR default-saveAt MCMC trace files (mu.dat/varE.dat/ETA_*.dat). The
# pipeline writes these into a per-fit tempdir (bglr_compute.R saveAt prefix)
# and deletes them; this only catches stray writes from a BGLR fit run with
# the default saveAt="" in the repo cwd (e.g. ad-hoc verification).
mu.dat
varE.dat
ETA_*.dat
